"╭ ╭ Keys ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮─╮"
"│ │ Everywhere                                    Room list                                      │ │"
"│ │  Tab         Next pane                         ↑           Previous room                     │ │"
"│▌│  Shift-Tab   Previous pane                     ↓           Next room                         │ │"
"│ │  Alt-←       Go to the room list               Enter       Open room and start typing        │ │"
"│ │  Alt-→       Go back to the chat               ?           This help                         │ │"
"│ │  Alt-↑       Go to the messages                                                              │ │"
"│ │  Alt-↓       Go to the composer               Messages                                       │ │"
"│ │  Alt-1       Room list                         ↑           Select older message              │ │"
"│ │  Alt-2       Messages                          ↓           Newer message, then composer      │ │"
"│ │  Alt-3       Composer                          Enter       Reply to selected message         │ │"
"│ │  Alt-R       Filter rooms                      e           Edit (own messages)               │ │"
"│ │  PgUp        Scroll messages up                r           React with an emoji               │ │"
"│ │  PgDn        Scroll messages down              Del         Delete (own messages)             │ │"
"│ │  Esc         Close, cancel or go back          c           Copy text                         │ │"
"│ │  Alt-E       Emoji picker                      s           Save file or picture              │ │"
"│ │  Alt-A       Attach a file                     v           View picture                      │ │"
"│ │  F1          This help                         o           Open link, picture or file        │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-↑      Previous room                     t           Open the message's thread         │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-↓      Next room                         End         Jump to newest                    │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-F      Find in this room                 ?           This help                         │ │"
"│ │  Alt-S       Next space (then all rooms)                                                     │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-K      Find a room                      Composer                                       │ │"
"│ │  F2          Settings                          Enter       Send                              │ │"
"│ │  F3          Next theme                        Shift-Enter Line break                        │ │"
"│ │  Ctrl-P      Command palette                   Alt-Enter   Line break (fallback)             │─╯"
"│ │  Ctrl-N      New chat or room…                 ↑           First line: select a message      │─╮"
"│ │  F4          Room info and members                                                           │ │"
"╰─╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── Esc to close ╯─╯"
" ● demo data  Enter send  Shift-Enter line break  Ctrl-P palette  F1 help  F2 settings  F3 rat-dark "
